.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt MOUNT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm mount
.Nd list or add a file: mount
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Ar scheme: path
.Nm
.Fl -selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The administrative interface and the full operand description are in
.Xr mount 8 .
The program is installed as
.Pa /sbin/mount ;
this section-1 entry exists because the tool's source package lives under
.Pa userland/bin
and the documentation gate requires a section-1 page for that package
directory as well as the section-8 page for the installed path.
.Pp
With no operands it lists
.Pa /etc/mounts
as
.Dq Aq scheme on Aq path .
.Fl -selftest
mounts and unmounts
.Ql ramfs:
at
.Pa /mnt .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount 8 ,
.Xr umount 8
